OL,4,BLammens - the Man Utd goalkeeper under 
OL,5,Bscrutiny like never before             
OL,6,GAfter a first season at Manchester     
OL,7,GUnited that drew little but praise,    
OL,8,Ggoalkeeper Senne Lammens is under the  
OL,9,Gmicroscope like never before.          
OL,11,FA bad mistake that gifted Sporting     
OL,12,Ftheir second goal on Wednesday, having 
OL,13,Fearlier conceded a clumsy penalty,     
OL,14,Ffollowed several other errors so far   
OL,15,Fthis season.                           
OL,17,FThe 24-year-old Belgium international  
OL,18,Falso made an error at the World Cup in 
OL,19,Fthe summer, spilling a shot that led   
OL,20,Fto Spain's winning goal in the 88th    
OL,21,Fminute of their quarter-final.         
